#### Castellan

Assigned By: A daimyō after putting the character in charge of the day-to-day management of a castle. A castle can have a single castellan.

Every Stone Has its Place (Title Ability): When undertaking a downtime activity to prepare your castle for an important event (a wedding, a battle, or a Winter Court, for example), you may change all rolled blank results to (op) results.

